      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 1. Register the request for subsequent tracking. Team: Demand Management. Tool: Pega. Output: Demand identifier. Status: C. Confidence: provisional (SNIP consolidated analysis model; verify against the governing Vodafone procedure.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
