    <bpmn:task id="DM_01" name="DM-01 Raise Demand on Single Front Door">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 2. Requestor raises the demand on the Single Front Door. Team: Requestor. Tool: Single Front Door (Pega). Output: G0. Confidence: provisional (Booklet flow, but the independent WS4 original for Single Front Door, DAM triage and Demand Board is not established; verify before confirming.)</bpmn:documentation>
